#: lib/tuist_web/live/organization_ai_settings_live.html.heex:715
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Anthropic stops billing your Claude organization for Tuist, and models using it are removed, along with their task routes. If one is the default, tasks without a route stop sending requests until you select another."
msgstr "Anthropic 會停止就 Tuist 向你的 Claude 組織計費，並移除相關模型及其任務路由。如果某個路由設為預設，則沒有路由的任務將停止發送請求，直到你選擇另一個路由為止。"

