#: lib/tuist_web/live/organization_ai_settings_live.ex:132
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Choose a task and a model. Each task can have only one route."
msgstr "選擇任務和模型。每個任務只能有一個路由。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/organization_ai_settings_live.html.heex:199
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Choose the model for organization AI tasks without a task route. Without a default, only routed tasks send requests. Personal AI subscriptions are not affected."
msgstr "為沒有任務路由的組織 AI 任務選擇模型。如果沒有預設值，只有已設定路由的任務才會發送請求。個人 AI 訂閱不受影響。"

