#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Send a specific task to a different model. Tasks without a route use the default model."
msgstr "將特定任務傳送至其他模型。沒有路由的任務會使用預設模型。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/organization_ai_settings_live.html.heex:279
